    "theory": "<h3>Связки, которые надо выучить</h3><table><tr><th>Предлог</th><th>Глаголы</th></tr><tr><td>to</td><td>listen to, talk to, belong to, apologize to, happen to</td></tr><tr><td>for</td><td>wait for, look for, pay for, apply for, ask for</td></tr><tr><td>on</td><td>depend on, rely on, focus on, insist on, concentrate on</td></tr><tr><td>about</td><td>think about, worry about, complain about, dream about</td></tr><tr><td>at</td><td>look at, laugh at, arrive at (место)</td></tr><tr><td>in</td><td>believe in, succeed in, arrive in (город/страна)</td></tr><tr><td>with</td><td>agree with, deal with, argue with</td></tr></table>\n<h3>Без предлога (в отличие от русского)</h3><p><b>discuss</b> something (не discuss about), <b>enter</b> a room, <b>call</b> someone, <b>answer</b> a question, <b>marry</b> someone, <b>reach</b> a place.</p>\n<div class=\"ex\"><b>We discussed the plan.</b><i>Мы обсудили план.</i></div><div class=\"ex\"><b>It depends on the weather.</b><i>Зависит от погоды (не «from»).</i></div>\n<div class=\"tip\">«Explain me» — ошибка. Правильно: explain something <b>to</b> me. Так же: describe it to me, say something to someone (но tell someone без to).</div>",
